e/tt1461395"},{"v":118626.0,"f":"118626"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/movie/118626"},{"v":"Date(2024,6,29)","f":"2024-07-29"},{"v":"Date(1899,11,30,0,44,44)","f":"00:44:44"},{"v":"She Wolf Rising"},{"v":"movies"},{"v":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTY2NDI5MjA1MV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMDE4NTY0NjE@._V1_.jpg"},{"v":3.1,"f":"3,1"},{"v":2016.0,"f":"2016"},{"v":"Marc Leland"},{"v":"Horror"},{"v":"She Wolf Rising: Directed by Marc Leland. With Tiffany Shepis, Debbie Rochon, Timothy Mandala, Ruby Larocca. A nonstop supernatural thriller that explores the dark side of underground filmmaking. Gina Sklar, the reigning queen of horror, portrayed by Tiffany Shepis, lures Jake Bubar (Tim Mandala) into the decadent world of illusions and myths. Robert Lonzo (J. Edmund Fond) is Gina\u0027s mentor and producer in the world of horror cinema. Someone has stolen the footage from his latest movie and Gina needs Jake\u0027s help to recover it. It\u0027s Lonzo\u0027s best movie ever and Gina\u0027s breakout performance. Gina believes that this movie could catapult her out of the \u0022B\u0022 world of films and into mainstream cinema. Jake struggles with his own demons internally but in the end cannot resist her. He only sees her vulnerability and beauty and will do anything to help. Jake\u0027s beliefs are challenged when he discovers Gina\u0027s true nature and realizes that the \u0022the heart becomes savage.\u0022 Together they forge ahead and deal with the demons and beasts that try to stop them from their forbidden desire."}]},{"c":[{"v":"1OxzUcgR"},{"v":"movie"},{"v":"Cassidy Way (2016)"},{"v":"tt3294664"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/movie/tt3294664"},{"v":384446.0,"f":"384446"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/movie/384446"},{"v":"Date(2024,6,29)","f":"2024-07-29"},{"v":"Date(1899,11,30,0,44,44)","f":"00:44:44"},{"v":"Cassidy Way"},{"v":"movies"},{"v":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTAzOTczMTc4NTZeQTJeQWpwZ15BbWU4MDk3MTg0MDQx._V1_.jpg"},{"v":3.6,"f":"3,6"},{"v":20