pper David Banner (The Butler), comedian Paul Mooney (The Chapelle Show),New York Times Best selling author Tariq Nasheed, Civil Rights activist/comedian Dick Gregory,Hip-Hop legend Nas,and many more."}]},{"c":[{"v":"7M5Y85om"},{"v":"movie"},{"v":"Froning: The Fittest Man in History (2015)"},{"v":"tt5079382"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/movie/tt5079382"},{"v":362226.0,"f":"362226"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/movie/362226"},{"v":"Date(2024,6,29)","f":"2024-07-29"},{"v":"Date(1899,11,30,1,44,38)","f":"01:44:38"},{"v":"Froning: The Fittest Man in History"},{"v":"movies"},{"v":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTUzMDM2NDIxMV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMzQ0MTg5NjE@._V1_.jpg"},{"v":6.6,"f":"6,6"},{"v":2015.0,"f":"2015"},{"v":"Heber Cannon"},{"v":"Documentary"},{"v":"Froning: The Fittest Man in History: Directed by Heber Cannon. With Rich Froning, Dan Bailey, Dave Castro, Matt Fraser. Rich Froning Jr. is a legend in CrossFit and the Sport of Fitness. In this biopic, take a look at his childhood, follow his quest for a fourth CrossFit Games title, and see him as a son, a husband and a new father."}]},{"c":[{"v":"7NS1Jqec"},{"v":"movie"},{"v":"Chicken Little (2005)"},{"v":"tt0371606"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/movie/tt0371606"},{"v":9982.0,"f":"9982"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/movie/9982"},{"v":"Date(2024,6,29)","f":"2024-07-29"},{"v":"Date(1899,11,30,1,44,38)","f":"01:44:38"},{"v":"Himmel und Huhn"},{"v":"movies"},{"v":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTM3MTIzMDQxMV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTYwNTE0Mjg3._V1_.jpg"},{"v":5.7,"f":"5,7"},{"v":2005.0,"f":"2005"},{"v":"Mark Dindal"},{"v":"Animation, Adventure, Comedy"},{"v":"Himmel und Huhn: Directed by Mark Dindal. With Zach Braff, Garry Marshall, Don Knotts, Patrick Stewart. After ruining his reputation with the town, a courageous chicken must come to the rescue of his fellow citizens when aliens start an invasion."}]},{"c":[{"v":"XGxKCWyp"},{"v":"movie"},{"v":"Black Dynamite (2010)"},{"v":"tt1190536"},{"v":"https://vidsr