"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/movie/13389"},{"v":"Date(2024,6,29)","f":"2024-07-29"},{"v":"Date(1899,11,30,5,44,51)","f":"05:44:51"},{"v":"Kurzer Prozess - Righteous Kill"},{"v":"movies"},{"v":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTYwMjg3MjY3OV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNTc4MDU3MQ@@._V1_.jpg"},{"v":6.0,"f":"6"},{"v":2008.0,"f":"2008"},{"v":"Jon Avnet"},{"v":"Crime, Mystery, Thriller"},{"v":"Kurzer Prozess - Righteous Kill: Directed by Jon Avnet. With Robert De Niro, Al Pacino, 50 Cent, Carla Gugino. Two veteran New York City detectives work on a case of serial executions of criminals who escaped justice."}]},{"c":[{"v":"dUPNZyFo"},{"v":"movie"},{"v":"The Four Feathers (2002)"},{"v":"tt0240510"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/movie/tt0240510"},{"v":9093.0,"f":"9093"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/movie/9093"},{"v":"Date(2024,6,29)","f":"2024-07-29"},{"v":"Date(1899,11,30,5,44,51)","f":"05:44:51"},{"v":"Die vier Federn"},{"v":"movies"},{"v":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTYzOTMxNzg0MV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTYwMjQwMDQ3._V1_.jpg"},{"v":6.5,"f":"6,5"},{"v":2002.0,"f":"2002"},{"v":"Shekhar Kapur"},{"v":"Action, Adventure, Drama"},{"v":"Die vier Federn: Directed by Shekhar Kapur. With Wes Bentley, Mohamed Bouich, Campbell Brown, Daniel Caltagirone. A young British officer resigns his commission just before his regiment is sent to battle and soon receives four white feathers from his friends and fiancee as symbols of what they view as his cowardice."}]},{"c":[{"v":"PxsRxAHw"},{"v":"movie"},{"v":"Tupac: Resurrection (2003)"},{"v":"tt0343121"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/movie/tt0343121"},{"v":21525.0,"f":"21525"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/movie/21525"},{"v":"Date(2024,6,29)","f":"2024-07-29"},{"v":"Date(1899,11,30,5,44,51)","f":"05:44:51"},{"v":"Tupac: Resurrection"},{"v":"movies"},{"v":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTY4OTY1NzI4N15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTYwNDI5MzQ3._V1_.jpg"},{"v":7.9,"f":"7,9"},{"v":2003.0,"f":"2003"},{"v":"Lauren Lazin"},{"v":"Documentary, Biography, Music"},{"v":"Tupac: Resurrection: Directed by Lauren Lazin. With Tupac Shakur, Rappin\u0027 4-Tay, Conrad Bain, Bill Bellamy. Home movies, photographs, and recited poetry illustrate the life of Tupac Shakur, one of the most beloved, revolutionary, and volatile hip-hop M.Cs. of all time."}]},{"c":[{"v":"a7jX8mVW"},{"v":"movie"},{"v":"The Last Emperor (1988)"},{"v":"tt0093389"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/movie/tt0093389"},{"v":746.0,"f":"746"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/movie/746"},{"v":"Date(2024,6,29)","f":"2024-07-29"},{"v":"Date(1899,11,30,5,44,52)","f":"05:44:52"},{"v":"Der letzte Kaiser"},{"v":"movies"},{"v":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNjhiZmRiYzEtMmZkNC00ZGJhLTk0NzItNWRiNjJlZmE5ZWY4XkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyMTYzMDM0NTU@._V1_.jpg"},{"v":7.7,"f":"7,7"},{"v":1987.0,"f":"1987"},{"v":"Bernardo Bertolucci"},{"v":"Biography, Drama, History"},{"v":"Der letzte Kaiser: Directed by Bernardo Bertolucci. With John Lone, Joan Chen, Peter O\u0027Toole, Ruocheng Ying. Bernardo Bertolucci\u0027s Oscar-winning dramatization of China\u0027s eleventh and final monarch of the Qing dynasty: Emperor Puyi."}]},{"c":[{"v":"NkT0ePPo"},{"v":"movie"},{"v":"Palio (2015)"},{"v":"tt3669520"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/movie/tt3669520"},{"v":332741.0,"f":"332741"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/movie/332741"},{"v":"Date(2024,6,29)","f":"2024-07-29"},{"v":"Date(1899,11,30,5,44,52)","f":"05:44:52"},{"v":"Palio"},{"v":"movies"},{"v":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNzIwNjI0ODkyMF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwNDY0MDE5NjE@._V1_.jpg"},{"v":7.3,"f":"7,3"},{"v":2015.0,"f":"2015"},{"v":"Cosima Spender"},{"v":"Documentary, Drama, Sport"},{"v":"Palio: Directed by Cosima Spender. Twice a year the Italian city of Siena goes crazy for the oldest horse race in the world: the Palio. Not your average race: strategy, bribery and corruption play as much a part as the skill of the riders. Horses are allocated by lot four days prior to the race. This is when the madness truly begins. In the eye of the storm stand the jockeys. Loved and loathed by the districts they represent, they forge alliances and make deals promising large cash sums to try and get the best start. Legendary rider Gigi Bruschelli has won 13 Palios in 16 years and is accused by his critics of monopolizing the race. He works the system, paying off younger jockeys and fixing the race with average horses. Two races away from beating the world record, Bruschelli will do anything to win. But one jockey stands in his way, his former trainee, a handsome young Sardinian, Giovanni Atzeni, who is quietly determined to challenge his old mentor. Less interested in bribes and collusion, he rides for the love of the race. PALIO is the thrilling story of a young \u0027outsider\u0027 keen to break in to the dangerous but lucrative race and the corrupt \u0027insider\u0027 who has manipulated the city of Siena for a decade. Their passionate and dramatic battle is an epic and cinematic tale of Italian life in microcosm."}]},{"c":[{"v":"KI1G1yiD"},{"v":"movie"},{"v":"War of the Buttons (1995)"},{"v":"tt0111666"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/movie/tt0111666"},{"v":38348.0,"f":"38348"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/movie/38348"},{"v":"Date(2024,6,29)","f":"2024-07-29"},{"v":"Date(1899,11,30,5,44,52)","f":"05:44:52"},{"v":"Krieg der Knöpfe"},{"v":"movies"},{"v":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMmYwMGJkMTgtZGRjMC00YjgwLWE3NDEtZWFjZWExMjg3MmEzXkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyNjc3MjQzNTI@._V1_.jpg"},{"v":7.3,"f":"7,3"},{"v":1994.0,"f":"1994"},{"v":"John Roberts"},{"v":"Adventure, Drama, Family"},{"v":"Krieg der Knöpfe: Directed by John Roberts. With Gregg Fitzgerald, Gerard Kearney, Darragh Naughton, Brendan McNamara. Children from Irish villages engage in mischievous battles using humiliating tactics like cutting off buttons and underwear. They sometimes engage in nude conflicts leading to embarrassing encounters."}]},{"c":[{"v":"ij4tQKND"},{"v":"movie"},{"v":"The Super (1991)"},{"v":"tt0103007"},{"v":"https://vidsrc.to/embed/m